---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout basePath="" title="Money & Career Confusion | Ask Astro Raja">

  <!-- PAGE HEADER -->
  <section class="pt-32 pb-16 px-4 bg-brand-light-bg text-center border-b border-brand-border">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <p class="text-brand-saffron font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-6 text-sm md:text-base">
        Money & Career Confusion
      </p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold text-brand-navy mb-6 tracking-tight">The invisible ceiling.</h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-brand-text leading-relaxed font-medium max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        "I earn but can't retain. Money comes and goes."
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CONTENT -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-16">
      
      <div class="prose prose-lg prose-brand max-w-none text-brand-navy">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">The Exhaustion of the Hustle</h2>
        <p class="mb-6">
          You've been working for years but still live paycheck to paycheck. You have 10 brilliant ideas but can't commit to a single one. Career feels like a perpetual guess, and the moment you start building real momentum or wealth, something always happens to reset you back to zero.
        </p>

        <div class="bg-slate-50 border-l-4 border-brand-saffron p-8 my-10 rounded-r-2xl">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-4">The Invisible Symptom</h3>
          <p class="mb-0">
            Financial growth is rarely stopped by a lack of opportunity. It is stopped by a behavioral pattern. If your subconscious operating system associates wealth with danger, guilt, or loss of freedom, it will automatically orchestrate "emergencies" to burn your capital. You are fighting an algorithm designed to keep you at your current financial baseline.
          </p>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">The Pattern</h3>
        <p class="mb-6">
          The cycle looks like this: Intense effort and focus -> Financial or career breakthrough -> Subconscious panic triggers your "safe baseline" protocol -> Impulsive decision, burnout, or manufactured crisis -> You return to your starting point -> "I just have bad luck."
        </p>

        <p class="mb-10">
          No amount of business strategy or budgeting apps will save you if your core code is programmed to reject stability.
        </p>

        <div class="text-center mt-16 pt-12 border-t border-brand-border">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-6">Diagnose Your Operating System</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-text mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto">
            Stop blaming the economy or your boss. Understand the behavioral blueprint that dictates your earning capacity, and get the exact daily system to rewrite it.
          </p>
          <a href="/get-reading" class="inline-block px-8 py-4 bg-brand-navy text-white rounded-xl font-bold text-lg hover:scale-105 hover:bg-brand-purple transition-transform shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl">
            Discover My Pattern
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
